<title>USA: Thomas &amp; Betts Q4 operating profit rises.</title>
<headline>Thomas &amp; Betts Q4 operating profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>THOMAS &amp; BETTS CORP</p>
<p>				Quarter Ended     Full Year Ended</p>
<p>			  Dec 29,    Dec 31     Dec 29,   Dec 31</p>
<p>			   1996	  1995	1996	1995</p>
<p>Net sales	     $501,586  $439,434 $1,985,145 $1,733,368</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>Cost of sales	 359,940    309,594  1,398,031  1,221,463</p>
<p>Mktg,G&amp;A		100,867     73,105    339,124    283,861</p>
<p>R&amp;D			11,764     10,954     47,229     44,083</p>
<p>Amort of intangibles  3,911	2,738     15,323     11,314</p>
<p>Merger expense	 30,558	  -	 30,558	  -</p>
<p>Prov-restructured ops24,501     18,700     24,501     18,700</p>
<p>Total expenses	531,541    415,091  1,854,766  1,579,421</p>
<p>Earnings from ops   (29,955)    24,343    130,379    153,947</p>
<p>Other expense-net    15,593	6,549     39,501     25,017</p>
<p>Earnings before taxes(45,548)-a 17,794-b   90,878(a) 128,930-b</p>
<p>Income taxes	  (14,749)     3,972     31,010     40,428</p>
<p>Net earnings	 $(30,799)   $13,822    $59,868    $88,502</p>
<p>Net EPS		  $(0.57)     $0.26	$1.13	$1.69</p>
<p>Avg shrs		 53,268     52,684     53,059     52,494</p>
<p>		    (In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 operating earnings excluding the impact of special charges were $34.8 million or $0.66 compared to Q4 1995 $29.1 million or $0.55</p>
<p>Net earnings for full year 1996 would have been $125.5 million or $2.36 per share compared to $103.8 million, or $1.98 per share in 1995 excluding the charges.</p>
<p>1995 amounts restated to include December 1996 merger with Augat Inc.</p>
<p>For 1996, outbound freight expense reclassified from marketing, general and administrative expenses to a contra sales item. 1995 amounts have been restated to conform to the 1996 method of presentation.</p>
